#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Unified Lead Generation Pipeline for SIF Agent — v6 (Enhanced Search + Scoring)
============================================================================
New in v6:
- Bing HTML search as complementary/fallback source (Source 3)
- Schema.org / JSON-LD structured data extraction (phone, email, name, city, rating)
- Parallelized scraping with ThreadPoolExecutor (3 workers)
- Fuzzy deduplication by company name (SequenceMatcher 85%) and email
- Enhanced scoring: Google rating, review count, years in business, certifications
- Years in business and certifications extraction from HTML text
- MAX_LEADS_PER_RUN reduced to 10 for tighter quality control per vertical

Carried from v5:
- Multi-vertical support via JSON config files (verticals/*.json)
- LLM-powered smart query generation (adapts searches each run)
- LLM-powered lead validation (rejects false positives, suggests pitch)
- Graceful fallback when LLM is unavailable
- Easy to add new verticals: just create a JSON file

Architecture:
- verticals/*.json define what to search, how to score, how to validate
- Pipeline loads active verticals and runs each one sequentially
- LLM calls are optional enhancements (pipeline works without them)

Designed to run daily via cron on EC2.
"""

